hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-49 = cons "**Ceptr: data that carries its own meaning.** Ceptr's semantic trees made every datum a structure tagged with a" (cons "symbol saying what it is, so a receiver could interpret it without an out-of-band schema. Semtrex, its regular" (cons "expressions over semantic trees, made matching on meaning a primitive. In hyperactivity, a value's type is its" (cons "meaning and the checker enforces it: Ceptr's symbols and structures become types, and matching on meaning becomes" (cons "elimination over a type and its identities. What hyperactivity adds is that two structures meaning the same thing" (cons "are related by an equivalence, and transport carries everything across it." (cons "" nil))))))
